WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Three hundred pages. Get through it today.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
I reason my way through. Half of it's already in.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Right. From page twelve I'll be improvising.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Fine. What did page 287 conclude?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
It was, uh, a very balanced conclusion overall.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
You did open the pages you never read. Those bill too.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Every trip to somebody else's cloud costs you per page.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
In here we can grind all night, one page at a time.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
No more pretending. This one's going to actually read it.

